OL,3,GNEWSAPatients waiting years for a
OL,4,A15-minute operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cataract patient waiting for more
OL,7,Fthan four years for an operation has
OL,8,Fsaid she cannot read, watch television,
OL,9,Fcross the road alone or drive.
OL,11,FElizabeth de Ferre, 70, from Jersey
OL,12,Fsaid she has had four operations
OL,13,Fscheduled and cancelled - the last two
OL,14,Fthis summer were cancelled on the day -
OL,15,Fand she was "angry".
OL,17,FFigures show 653 patients had waited
OL,18,Fmore than a year in the island for an
OL,19,Foperation despite 400 being sent to the
OL,20,FUK between 2024 and 2025 to cut the
OL,21,Fwaiting list.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
