OL,3,GNEWSAPatients waiting years for a
OL,4,A15-minute operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FClaire Thompson, the chief operating
OL,7,Fofficer ` Acute Services for Health and
OL,8,FCare Jersey, said they were aware "some
OL,9,FIslanders have waited too long" and
OL,10,Fthey were recruiting more permanent
OL,11,Fclinical staff.
